    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead Da Revolushun in Goblin Shaman! The only RPG where your party outnumbers your enemies! Lead a goblin horde in their fight for freedom against the oppressive hobgoblins &amp; orcs in this epic revolutionary tale.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Endless Horde</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803730/extras/eff778a99d698b69a027d3d790c3c6e7.poster.avif?t=1749521010\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803730/extras/eff778a99d698b69a027d3d790c3c6e7.webm?t=1749521010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803730/extras/eff778a99d698b69a027d3d790c3c6e7.mp4?t=1749521010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whenever a Goblin in your squad dies, they\u2019re instantly replaced by the next in line. Lead a green tide of scrappy fighters from the deep underground all the way to the Orcish war foundry in your fight for freedom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guerilla Tactics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803730/extras/ed0a08668a1182b9d6eaab25df3b7b51.avif?t=1749521010\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split your goblins into squads and tackle missions in a non-linear campaign. Resupply, sabotage, and strike from the shadows. Each mission features its own mini-plot told in the style of classic visual novels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Some of You May Die\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803730/extras/36192dc0fd43d83ed30ba34133fb54bc.poster.avif?t=1749521010\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803730/extras/36192dc0fd43d83ed30ba34133fb54bc.webm?t=1749521010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803730/extras/36192dc0fd43d83ed30ba34133fb54bc.mp4?t=1749521010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblins who die stay dead! Thankfully you have dozens at your disposal. Take care of your best and brightest, and send the rest to die on the front line. War is messy, goblins are cheap!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully hand-drawn world to revolt in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique horde-based party combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated goblin names such a \u201cGazbot\u201d and \u201cWeebo\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Goblin is unique, from their face to their traits to their luck!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlucky Goblins may be torn to shreds or crushed by boulders!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead Da Revolushun in Goblin Shaman! The only RPG where your party outnumbers your enemies! Lead a goblin horde in their fight for freedom against the oppressive hobgoblins &amp; orcs in this epic revolutionary tale.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Endless Horde</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803730/extras/eff778a99d698b69a027d3d790c3c6e7.poster.avif?t=1749521010\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803730/extras/eff778a99d698b69a027d3d790c3c6e7.webm?t=1749521010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803730/extras/eff778a99d698b69a027d3d790c3c6e7.mp4?t=1749521010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whenever a Goblin in your squad dies, they\u2019re instantly replaced by the next in line. Lead a green tide of scrappy fighters from the deep underground all the way to the Orcish war foundry in your fight for freedom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guerilla Tactics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803730/extras/ed0a08668a1182b9d6eaab25df3b7b51.avif?t=1749521010\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split your goblins into squads and tackle missions in a non-linear campaign. Resupply, sabotage, and strike from the shadows. Each mission features its own mini-plot told in the style of classic visual novels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Some of You May Die\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803730/extras/36192dc0fd43d83ed30ba34133fb54bc.poster.avif?t=1749521010\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803730/extras/36192dc0fd43d83ed30ba34133fb54bc.webm?t=1749521010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803730/extras/36192dc0fd43d83ed30ba34133fb54bc.mp4?t=1749521010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblins who die stay dead! Thankfully you have dozens at your disposal. Take care of your best and brightest, and send the rest to die on the front line. War is messy, goblins are cheap!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully hand-drawn world to revolt in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique horde-based party combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated goblin names such a \u201cGazbot\u201d and \u201cWeebo\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Goblin is unique, from their face to their traits to their luck!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlucky Goblins may be torn to shreds or crushed by boulders!</p></li></ul>",
